## Database Management

### Prisma Studio

View and edit your database using Prisma Studio:

```bash
npx prisma studio
```

### Migrations

Create a new migration:

```bash
npx prisma migrate dev --name your_migration_name
```

Reset the database:

```bash
npx prisma migrate reset
```

